{"strongs": "H2766", "word": "חָרִם", "translit": "cha.rim", "root": "חרם", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "consecrated", "definition": "חָרִם proper name, masculine ( consecrated ; compare Sabean proper name, masculine חרם , יחרמאל Hal 411. 504 DHM l.c .) — 1. priest of the third course, David's time, according to 1Chr 24:8 . 2. priest of time of Nehemiah Neh 10:6 . 3. heads of families of returning exiles: \\ \\ a. Ezra 2:39 = Neh 7:42 ; Ezra 10:21 ; Neh 12:15 . \\ \\ b. Ezra 2:32 = Neh 7:35 ; Ezra 10:31 ; Neh 3:11 . 4. a prince Neh 10:28 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3130')\">BDB3130</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2766')\">H2766</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3129')\">BDB3129</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3131')\">BDB3131</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חָרִם</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>consecrated</highlight>; compare Sabean proper name, masculine <bdbheb>חרם</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יחרמאל</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hal')\">Hal<sup>411. 504</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM<sup>l.c</sup></lookup>.) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> priest of the third course, David's time, according to <ref ref=\"1Chr 24:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,24,8)\">1Chr 24:8</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> priest of time of Nehemiah <ref ref=\"Neh 10:6\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,6)\">Neh 10:6</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> heads of families of returning exiles: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:39\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,39)\">Ezra 2:39</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 7:42\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,42)\">Neh 7:42</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:21\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=